        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_London%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "New London sits at the crossroads of US Route 61 and Missouri Route 19, just eight miles south of Hannibal.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17,
        19
