      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_London%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Salt River runs a mile or two north and east of town, while the Mississippi lies about nine miles to the east.",
